<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine Sept inflation 4.4 pct vs Aug 7.9.</title>
<headline>Philippine Sept inflation 4.4 pct vs Aug 7.9.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippines' inflation rate fell to 4.4 percent in September year on year from 7.9 percent in August, the National Statistics Office said on Friday.  </p>
<p>It said the September rate was the lowest since July 1987 and helped bring down the average inflation rate for 1996 to 9.7 percent from 10.3 percent in August.</p>
<p>    CONSUMER PRICES	   Sept 96   Aug 96   Sept 95</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change    -0.2	+1.0	+1.1</p>
<p>    Yr-on-yr change	    +4.4	+7.9     +11.3</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=1988)   230.2     230.6     220.4</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom (632) 841-8914 Fax 817-6267</p>
